  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "3.3.0: data and options types (PushMessage<T>, AndroidOptions, IosOptions, WebOptions, PushResult, PushDispatchResult, StoredNotification, DeviceRegistration, FirebaseOptions, RetryOptions, MessagingOptions, FirebaseStoreOptions) are no longer sealed, so they can be inherited. Service/infrastructure classes remain sealed. Non-breaking: existing code is unaffected.",
